[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package turns two upstream defaults around.

Telemetry is off. Left alone, kimi-code reports usage, crashes and a first
launch event to Moonshot AI without asking. Put telemetry = true in
~/.kimi-code/config.toml if you want it back.

The built-in updater is inert, because these files belong to pkg. Use
pkg upgrade kimi-code for a newer version.

kimi calls git for its status line and diffs and rg for searching the
tree; both come in as dependencies.
EOM
}
]
